# The installed Roc Solid this app builds with: a link rocx makes (.rocx-version says which)
/.rocx
# Written by rocx build: Generated/ (the routes, Api, Paths, App, Styles), and the .roc beside each
# component's .rocx
Generated/
components/*.roc
# Secrets the server reads as it starts (ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=…, SMTP_URL=…): never committed
.env
# Builds (rocx build's dist/ and image), and the database's files
build/
dist/
*.tar
data/
*.db*
